# Q1 — Does `opencode serve` pick up OPENCODE_API_KEY from env; is AGENCY_MODEL listed by `opencode models`?
Date: 2026-10-13. Key: .env.provider present, mode 0600, non-empty OPENCODE_API_KEY
(value never shown, never copied here). .env: AGENCY_MODEL=opencode-go/muse-spark-1.3-contributor.

